                "span": 12
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "appt-faq-list",
                  "type": "widget",
                  "props": {
                    "widget": "faq",
                    "config": {
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "q": "How do I schedule a service appointment at Sun State?",
                          "a": "Submit the online service appointment request form on this page, or call 800-741-7566. You can also reach the Tampa Service Department directly at (813) 521-8053, Sarasota at (941) 541-3251 and Davenport at (863) 238-2939."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Is this a confirmed appointment?",
                          "a": "Your request reserves a place in the schedule. A service advisor contacts you to confirm the date and time, review the work needed and answer questions before your unit arrives."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "What information should I have ready?",
                          "a": "Have your VIN or unit number, year, make and model, current mileage or hours, and a short description of the symptoms or the maintenance due. Fault codes and recent repair history help our technicians diagnose faster."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Can you come to my location instead?",
                          "a": "Yes. Request mobile service on the form and our mobile team can perform many repairs, diagnostics and preventative maintenance at your yard or job site, reducing downtime and the cost of transporting the unit."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Do you schedule trailer service as well as truck service?",
                          "a": "Yes. The same form schedules trucks, trailers, buses and yard trucks. Sun State Trailers online service appointments offer easier scheduling, assisted fleet management and comprehensive service history tracking."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "What if my truck breaks down after hours?",
                          "a": "Certified Fleet provides after-hours support from 5:00 PM to 8:00 AM. Call 800-741-7566 for assistance outside of service department hours."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "How soon will I hear back?",
                          "a": "Requests submitted during service department hours are typically answered the same business day. Requests submitted overnight or on weekends are handled the next business morning."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
